{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "upwork-workflow-generator", "elements": [{"id": "rectangle_29", "type": "rectangle", "x": -104, "y": -90, "width": 1396, "height": 218, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9db7e6", "backgroundColor": "#e7f0fd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 507088657, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1795823849, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_30", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": -74, "width": 1352, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e4f9c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 708506837, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1469118511, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - GROWTH STRATEGY", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1 - GROWTH STRATEGY", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_31", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": -38, "width": 1352, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 652768598, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2100080515, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A clear growth strategy means one pain, one offer and one buyer in maritime logistics.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "A clear growth strategy means one pain, one offer and one buyer in maritime logistics.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_32", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1492, "y": -106, "width": 1048, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9fd1a8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f6ea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1811180650, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 168393880, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_33", "type": "text", "x": 1514, "y": -90, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1f6b30", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 333377415, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1347535309, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - MARKETING", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 - MARKETING", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_34", "type": "text", "x": 1514, "y": -54, "width": 1004, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1460814403, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1504004732, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Marketing is outbound straight to maritime logistics companies. Each email talks about that company's own lanes and services, not AI in\ngeneral.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Marketing is outbound straight to maritime logistics companies. Each email talks about that company's own lanes and services, not AI in\ngeneral.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_35", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2738, "y": -106, "width": 1048, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 2133201996, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1959386987, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_36", "type": "text", "x": 2760, "y": -90, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 295334610, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 401991736, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - SALES PROCESS", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - SALES PROCESS", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_37", "type": "text", "x": 2760, "y": -54, "width": 1004, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1159380354, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2036236842, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The sales process goes from reply to call to proposal without waiting days. The call puts a cost on their manual work, so the pilot price\nmakes sense to them.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "The sales process goes from reply to call to proposal without waiting days. The call puts a cost on their manual work, so the pilot price\nmakes sense to them.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_38", "type": "rectangle", "x": 3986, "y": -106, "width": 700, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e6c97a", "backgroundColor": "#fff5df", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 279172787, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 260573196, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_39", "type": "text", "x": 4008, "y": -90, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8a5a00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1329753548, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1914012529, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 - DAY-TO-DAY OPERATIONS", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "4 - DAY-TO-DAY OPERATIONS", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_40", "type": "text", "x": 4008, "y": -54, "width": 656, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1222328496, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1656961616, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Day-to-day operations run on a weekly rhythm. Every Monday you know what was sent, who\nreplied, what sold and what is being delivered.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Day-to-day operations run on a weekly rhythm. Every Monday you know what was sent, who\nreplied, what sold and what is being delivered.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_41", "type": "rectangle", "x": 4884, "y": -106, "width": 700, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8fd0d8", "backgroundColor": "#e4f7f9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1490376254, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 96907016, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_42", "type": "text", "x": 4906, "y": -90, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0e5f6a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1982966163, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1526706730, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "5 - ONGOING BUSINESS DEVELOPMENT", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "5 - ONGOING BUSINESS DEVELOPMENT", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_43", "type": "text", "x": 4906, "y": -54, "width": 656, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 721762279, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 502922617, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Ongoing business development turns each pilot into proof and into a retainer. Every month\nthe numbers decide which new opportunity comes next.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Ongoing business development turns each pilot into proof and into a retainer. Every month\nthe numbers decide which new opportunity comes next.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_1", "type": "rectangle", "x": -68, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1390851129, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 647892280, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_2"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_44"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_2", "type": "text", "x": -56.0, "y": 12.5, "width": 256, "height": 75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1695753999, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 207388625, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - We start with one pain\nmaritime logistics teams feel\ndaily, like slow freight\nquotes.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_1", "originalText": "1 - We start with one pain\nmaritime logistics teams feel\ndaily, like slow freight\nquotes.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_3", "type": "rectangle", "x": 280, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 311111476, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 404285458, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_4"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_44"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_45"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_4", "type": "text", "x": 292.0, "y": 21.875, "width": 256, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1570621945, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 249103478, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - The first offer is a paid\npilot that automates quoting\nor bill of lading data entry.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_3", "originalText": "2 - The first offer is a paid\npilot that automates quoting\nor bill of lading data entry.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_5", "type": "rectangle", "x": 628, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 922121677, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 161042649, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_6"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_45"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_46"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_6", "type": "text", "x": 640.0, "y": 21.875, "width": 256, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 369140571, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1862494043, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - The buyers are ops heads\nat freight forwarders, customs\nbrokers and ship agents.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_5", "originalText": "3 - The buyers are ops heads\nat freight forwarders, customs\nbrokers and ship agents.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_7", "type": "rectangle", "x": 976, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1796035740, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 300026768, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_8"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_46"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_47"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_8", "type": "text", "x": 988.0, "y": 21.875, "width": 256, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1033639717, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 389609434, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 - Your monthly client target\ndecides how many forwarders we\nemail each week.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_7", "originalText": "4 - Your monthly client target\ndecides how many forwarders we\nemail each week.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_9", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1528, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1823296039, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 253877687, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_10"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_47"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_48"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_10", "type": "text", "x": 1540.0, "y": 12.5, "width": 256, "height": 75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 531725348, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 958804058, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "5 - Lead lists come from\nforwarder directories and\nLinkedIn, sorted by trade\nlanes.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_9", "originalText": "5 - Lead lists come from\nforwarder directories and\nLinkedIn, sorted by trade\nlanes.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_11", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1876, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 265695474, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1703729685, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_12"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_48"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_49"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_12", "type": "text", "x": 1888.0, "y": 12.5, "width": 256, "height": 75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 212984477, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 949539217, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "6 - Claude reads each\ncompany's website and writes\nan email about their own\nlanes.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_11", "originalText": "6 - Claude reads each\ncompany's website and writes\nan email about their own\nlanes.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_13", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2224, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 200071089, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 571981486, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_14"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_49"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_50"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_14", "type": "text", "x": 2236.0, "y": 21.875, "width": 256, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1243862423, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1800188483, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "7 - Cold emails go out every\nweekday in Instantly from\npre-warmed inboxes.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_13", "originalText": "7 - Cold emails go out every\nweekday in Instantly from\npre-warmed inboxes.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_15", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2774, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 619570853, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 505913793, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_16"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_50"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_51"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_16", "type": "text", "x": 2786.0, "y": 21.875, "width": 256, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1324919353, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 776213900, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "8 - Interested replies get two\ncall times within the hour,\nand quiet ones get follow-ups.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_15", "originalText": "8 - Interested replies get two\ncall times within the hour,\nand quiet ones get follow-ups.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_17", "type": "rectangle", "x": 3122, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 442620899, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 806899910, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_18"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_51"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_52"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_18", "type": "text", "x": 3134.0, "y": 21.875, "width": 256, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1599435268, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 418461139, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "9 - On the call we map their\nquoting or paperwork process\nand put a cost on it.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_17", "originalText": "9 - On the call we map their\nquoting or paperwork process\nand put a cost on it.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_19", "type": "rectangle", "x": 3470, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 269676600, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 255985077, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_20"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_52"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_53"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_20", "type": "text", "x": 3482.0, "y": 21.875, "width": 256, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 884585952, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2132084005, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "10 - The proposal goes out the\nsame day with the pilot scope,\nthe price and a start date.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_19", "originalText": "10 - The proposal goes out the\nsame day with the pilot scope,\nthe price and a start date.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_21", "type": "rectangle", "x": 4022, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1836494975, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1349251824, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_22"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_53"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_54"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_22", "type": "text", "x": 4034.0, "y": 12.5, "width": 256, "height": 75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1999744785, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1946412081, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "11 - Every Monday we review\nemails sent, replies, calls\nbooked, pilots sold and\ndelivery.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_21", "originalText": "11 - Every Monday we review\nemails sent, replies, calls\nbooked, pilots sold and\ndelivery.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_23", "type": "rectangle", "x": 4370, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1552984409, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1287489454, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_24"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_54"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_55"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_24", "type": "text", "x": 4382.0, "y": 12.5, "width": 256, "height": 75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1066984056, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 772092315, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "12 - Each client gets one\nonboarding checklist and a\nweekly update until the pilot\nships.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_23", "originalText": "12 - Each client gets one\nonboarding checklist and a\nweekly update until the pilot\nships.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_25", "type": "rectangle", "x": 4920, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1048386556, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 351564608, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_26"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_55"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_56"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_26", "type": "text", "x": 4932.0, "y": 21.875, "width": 256, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1289560150, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2126508551, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "13 - Every finished pilot\nbecomes a maritime case study\nwith its before and after.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_25", "originalText": "13 - Every finished pilot\nbecomes a maritime case study\nwith its before and after.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_27", "type": "rectangle", "x": 5268, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1475216846, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1927728187, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_28"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_56"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_28", "type": "text", "x": 5280.0, "y": 21.875, "width": 256, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1236683273, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 314395343, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "14 - Each month we turn pilots\ninto retainers and pick the\nnext segment to go after.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_27", "originalText": "14 - Each month we turn pilots\ninto retainers and pick the\nnext segment to go after.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "arrow_44", "type": "arrow", "x": 212, "y": 50, "width": 68, "height": 1, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundC